        <mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;Siapa boleh bertindak&lt;/b&gt; (fn_User_ActionableSteps): langkah PENDING + StartedAt di ronde terakhir, status request sesuai titik, user punya RoleCode, Company sama (BR-63), lingkup DEPT = ABRV sama (BR-24) / GROUP = dept anggota grup / PLANT, bukan requester (BR-30). Yang pertama bertindak berlaku (BR-39).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Role action&lt;/b&gt;: [RoleAuthorize(kabag, mo, gm, director)] pada RequestController.ApprovalAct." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
