        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" value="Satu sumber: dbo.fn_User_Tasks → usp_Task_GetList (halaman MyTask) dan usp_Task_GetSummary (badge header, Home, Dashboard). Semua tugas dibatasi fn_User_AllowedDepartments. TaskSince = StartedAt langkah / waktu status terakhir. Tidak ada penanda overdue (BR-32), kecuali warning Emergency (BR-65)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
